Backend Render environment:
DATABASE_URL=jdbc:postgresql://<host>/<database>?sslmode=require
DATABASE_USERNAME=<neon-user>
DATABASE_PASSWORD=<neon-password>
DATABASE_DRIVER=org.postgresql.Driver
JPA_DIALECT=org.hibernate.dialect.PostgreSQLDialect
JPA_DDL_AUTO=update
JWT_SECRET=<at-least-32-random-characters>
ATTENDANCE_APPROVAL_REQUIRED=true
CRM_SLA_NEW_LEAD_CONTACT_HOURS=4
CRM_SLA_FOLLOW_UP_RESPONSE_HOURS=24
CRM_SLA_SCHEDULER_DELAY_MS=300000
CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://<your-vercel-app>.vercel.app,http://localhost:5173

Frontend Vercel environment:
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://<your-render-service>.onrender.com/api
